# Venser, Fervent Forger: "Create two tokens that are copies of target permanent an opponent controls" - the tokens are
# made as the ability resolves, and a permanent that has left the battlefield by then is copied not at all (CR 608.2b), so
# no tokens and no sacrifice at the end step. Bot1 casts Venser in its main phase, the trigger targets Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves, and Bot1 answers its own trigger with Cut Down.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Venser, Fervent Forger
Island
Cut Down
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x13

